  "decisions": [
    "canPlace=false; centered item cuboid [0,0,7]..[16,16,9]",
    "48 colored construction panels and 30 available native plank panels; no 300 reserved phantom slots",
    "six screws from ANY.Iron, one exact colored construction block or native plank, saw and screwdriver, six outputs",
    "original CR.NCC means no recipe collision check, not disable autocrafting; preserve mirror opt-in",
    "source PlankData indices retained only where unambiguous; modern woods and ambiguous dictionary slots are extensions without invented numeric original ids",
    "keep six legacy block registry identities and saved edge geometry; disable new direct placement; new variants are plain cover items",
    "original decorative textures, source DYES RGB, wood uses untinted plank texture and plank-name tooltip",
    "source wood/stone dig sound on attachment/removal; asphalt horizontal speed x1.3 only when moving, not in water, not sneaking",
    "Source ANY.Iron:119 has eleven source names including optional external Enori. Preserve existing aggregate tags; verify four actual native aliases and a copper negative. No external Enori placeholder is added.",
    "Construction-color preview serializes ingredient identity without resolving tags during recipe construction, before native tag binding. Network decode restores the exact color preview; tag caches remain lazy."
  ],
